        "product_summary": "Panelled winter upper: Grained forefoot sections combine with matte side overlays and curved stitched panel lines.\nPlush interior: The opened boot shows black plush along the shaft and tongue, with a mesh collar edge.\nLace-up fittings: Round eyelets and an upper metal guide hold the crossed laces, with pull loops at the tongue and heel.\nEVA outsole profile: Angular tread blocks extend across the visible underside beneath a sculpted black sidewall.\nWholesale colour-size options: Black and Black Grey are offered in EU 39–48 for winter assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
